     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I need to plot multiple CIs and compare them ... I manage to do so with a code similar to the example included below. However, I could not find any way to add a Legend to indicate which CI corresponds to which method ... can anyone please advise?</div><div><br></div><div>Many thanks in advance,</div><div>Best regards,</div><div>Giovanni</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rm</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">list</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ls</span>())                                              <span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># clear workspace</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">library</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggplot2</span>)                                           <span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># use ggplot2 library</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153);min-height:17px\"><br></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,10)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">methodlabels</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span>&quot;Classic&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">, </span>&quot;Own Bootstrap&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,              </span><span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># prepare plot labels </span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:rgb(176,19,10)\">&quot;R Bootstrap&quot;</span>)               </div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,10)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">errortypelabels</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span>&quot;&#39;Normal&#39;&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">, </span>&quot;&#39;Student-t&#39;&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,            </span><span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># prepare plot labels</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,10)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>&quot;&#39;Exponential&#39;&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(176,19,10)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">betalabels</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span>&quot;&#39;Beta_1&#39;&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">, </span>&quot;&#39;Beta_2&#39;&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">, </span>&quot;&#39;Beta_3&#39;&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)        </span><span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># prepare plot labels</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">betas</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span>, -<span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">2</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">3</span>)                                       <span style=\"color:rgb(79,79,79)\"># my real parameters</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\">set.seed<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">11</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">S</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">100</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">B</span> &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">50</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\">P<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span>length<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span>betas<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\">classiccis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span>owncis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span>rbootcis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"> &lt;- </span>array<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span>data<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>dim<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span>c<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span>S<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">))</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco;color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(195,137,29)\">for</span> (<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">p</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(195,137,29)\">in</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">P</span>) {</div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>classiccis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">] &lt;- </span>rnorm<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">100</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>mean<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span>betas<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">]-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>sd<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>classiccis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">] &lt;- </span>rnorm<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">100</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>mean<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span>betas<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">]+</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>sd<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>owncis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">] &lt;- </span>rnorm<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">100</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>mean<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span>betas<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">]-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>sd<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;font:normal normal normal 13px/normal Monaco\"><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>owncis<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">[,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span>p<span style=\"color:rgb(23,23,153)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(5,81,25)\">2</sp